---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";

const seo = {
  page_description: "Privacy Policy for FoodLogTrack.",
  no_index: false,
};
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy" seo={seo}>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 prose text-text">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-primary mb-6">Privacy Policy</h1>

    <p><strong>Last Updated: January 1, 2024</strong></p>

    <p>At FoodLogTrack, your privacy is our priority. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your information when you use our website.</p>

    <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>We collect minimal information to provide you with our services. When you use our calculators, the data is processed locally in your browser. We do not store your age, weight, or gender on our servers.</p>
    <p>If you submit a contact form or subscribe to our newsletter, we collect the information you provide (such as your name and email address) securely via our capture endpoint.</p>

    <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <p>We use the information you provide to respond to your inquiries and, if you opt-in, to send you our newsletter and meal plans. We do not sell your personal information to third parties.</p>

    <h2>3. Telemetry and Analytics</h2>
    <p>We use privacy-respecting analytics to understand how our site is used. This data is anonymized and helps us improve our content and calculators.</p>

    <h2>4. Contact Us</h2>
    <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us via our <a href="/contact/">Contact page</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
